  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BLR Economic Research and Outreach Center - Phase III BEROC - BEROC Economic Research and Outreach Centre, Phase III</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">BLR Economic Research and Outreach Center - fas III BEROC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">- The aim of the project &#xab;To develop the next phase of &#x2018;Belarusian Economic Research and Outreach Center&#x2019; (BEROC)&#xbb; is &#xab;to develop market economy in the Republic of Belarus through high-quality public dialogue that is supported by high standard analytics and expertise, generated by BEROC, with the aim to spread knowledge in economics by way of research, as well as to increase skills in economics of policy-makers, business and academic communities through educational programmes. BEROC&#x2019;s motto is &#xab;modern economic thinking for Belarus&#xbb;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">BEROC &#xe4;r en oberoende ekonomisk tankesmedja, unik i sitt slag i Vitryssland. BEROCs uppdrag &#xe4;r att verka f&#xf6;r ekonomisk utveckling och marknadsekonomi, genom att tillf&#xf6;ra modernt ekonomiskt kunnande, analyser, ekonomisk forskning samt delta i den offentliga dialogen kring ekonomisk utveckling. BEROC avser vidare att bidra till att utveckla kompetens p&#xe5; det ekonomiska omr&#xe5;det i Vitryssland genom att utveckla en modern utbildning i finansiell ekonomi, i samarbete med ISM University i Vilnius, Litauen. BEROCs &#xf6;vergripande syfte &#xe4;r att bidra till ekonomisk och marknadsorienterad utveckling i Vitryssland, framf&#xf6;r allt genom att tillhandh&#xe5;lla modern ekonomisk forskning och analyser, f&#xf6;r ber&#xf6;rda beslutsfattare i samh&#xe4;llet.

Det svenska bidraget &#xe4;r avsett i huvudsak som k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till BEROC, genom SITE, f&#xf6;r deras drift och administration</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to BEROC, an economics think tank with the mission to promote market economy in Belarus by bringing economic expertise, knowledge, and education into the public dialogue on economic development. Its overall goals are to promote economic reforms and development of market economy in Belarus</narrative>
  </description>
